.TH VCAM-GUI 1 "2026-10-20" "vcam 0.2.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
vcam-gui \- GTK4 control panel for the vcam virtual camera
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B vcam-gui
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B vcam-gui
is a libadwaita control panel for
.BR vcamd (1).
It shows a live preview of the virtual camera and lets you choose a video,
play, pause, stop, seek, toggle looping, change the output format and run the
diagnostics.
.PP
It is an IPC client: it never owns the camera pipeline, and it can be used
alongside
.BR vcam (1).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR vcam (1),
.BR vcamd (1)
